# Composables

Full map: `src/runtime/composables/README.md`.

- `useComponentProps` is a proxy. `ui` is `defu(instance, appConfig.ui[name].slots)` so the instance wins.
- Any other key uses the prop when it is not `undefined`, otherwise `app.config.ui[name].defaultVariants`.
- This proxy does not read `theme.defaultVariants`.
- A new composable used by apps must be exported from `index.ts` and registered in both `module.ts` (`addImports`) and `createViteIntegrations`.
- Read config through `#imports` `useAppConfig`, not through `src/shims`.
